# Client audio, transcripts and outputs stay local. The style sets are the one
# exception: the app cannot grade anything without them and the tests read them,
# so they are tracked deliberately.
#
# `data/*` rather than `data/`: git will not re-include a path whose parent
# directory is excluded, so excluding the directory itself would make the
# negation below silently do nothing.
data/*
!data/StyleSets/

